      "asked_as": "1a1db65e-52d5-493b-a1a9-7e495005530a",
      "http_status": 200,
      "seconds": 21.16,
      "answer": "SIM bundles are managed through the SIM Cards module, which handles SIM inventory, telco relationships, APN profiles, data bundles, roaming, and signal quality. It provides suspend and reactivate actions, cost visibility, and maps SIMs to devices, assets, and countries. This helps prevent surprise bills, silent outages, and ensures continuous communication for vehicles, people, cargo, generators, and remote equipment.\n\nSource: OLIWA User Stories — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
