      "answer": "Tracking tokens in the NAVAS ecosystem are used to bill for GPS tracking services based on time. Customers pay for tracking by the hour, day, or month, allowing them to only incur costs when their assets are active. This model supports pause and resume functionality, making it flexible for different usage patterns.\n\nSource: NAVAS Token Billing Strategy — this is the documented design; I can't confirm from here which parts are live.",
